# PO forwarders — admin-registered, Air/Sea per company

## Invariant

Real logistics company names, phones, and Korean warehouse addresses are **not** code defaults.
Admins register them in PO Section 3 → **Manage forwarders** (`selpic-po-forwarders` localStorage).

Canonical example (tests / admin placeholders only — **never seed** live store):
`lib/poForwarderExample.ts` → **Hana One Express (하나원택배)**

| Mode | Recipient / Attn | Phone | Domestic address | Carton template |
|------|------------------|-------|------------------|-----------------|
| Sea | `브리즈번해상` | `010-2846-3366` | `경기도 김포시 승가로 110-30 (SELPIC / +61 466 894 279)` | `SELPIC / 브리즈번해상 / PO No: {PO_NUMBER}` |
| Air | `브리즈번항공` | same | same address | `SELPIC / 브리즈번항공 / PO No: {PO_NUMBER}` |

Note: SELPIC AU phone belongs in the **address** parentheses, **not** inside Recipient/Attn.

## Built-in destinations only

- `selpic_au` — SELPIC AU Warehouse
- `custom` — Custom Address

Korean hubs = `poForwarderStore` records with `modes.sea` and `modes.air`.
When a registered forwarder + Sea/Air is selected on the PO, hub fields are **read-only** (edit via Manage forwarders).

## Approved domestic hub instruction block (UI + PDF)

Use `buildDomesticHubInstructionBlock` only. Layout:

```
================================================================================
Ship To / Domestic Logistics Hub (공급처 국내 배송지 정보)
================================================================================
* [공급사 필독] …

- 배 송 업 체 (Forwarder Company) : {FORWARDER_NAME} ({TRANSPORT_MODE})
- 수취인 명의 (Recipient / Attn)  : {RECIPIENT_ATTN}
- 연  락  처 (Phone Number)      : {HUB_PHONE}
- 배송지 주소 (Domestic Address) : {DOMESTIC_ADDRESS}

[박스 외관 필수 표기 지침 (Carton Marking)]
* …
  "{CARTON_MARKING}"
================================================================================
```

`TRANSPORT_MODE` = `Sea Freight` | `Air Freight`. Snapshot `shipTo.forwarderName` when applying a forwarder so PDF does not depend on live store.

## Do not

- Hardcode “Forwarder A/B” placeholders as selectable defaults
- Copy owner/spec sample company details into `getDefaultPurchaseOrderDoc`
- Confuse **suppliers** (`selpic-po-suppliers`) with **forwarders** (배대지)
- Drop the Forwarder Company line or invent a different block layout
